300 joint draws at I1-I3 (every price and share): with draws.json (libm 0.2.16's pow) 300 equal bit for bit, 0 differ; with Python's ** (glibc) 126 equal, 174 differ in at least one factor. The tapes' market orders: {'i1': ['labour', 'land', 'mach', 'manufactures', 'food', 'care', 'shelter'], 'i2': ['labour', 'land', 'engine', 'power', 'good'], 'i3': ['labour', 'land', 'engine', 'power', 'manufactures', 'food', 'care', 'shelter']}
